      "writtenOn": "2020-12-09T06:05:06Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Technically ConnectivityService doesn\u0027t really care whether it\u0027s passpoint or some other system; since wifi is an updatable module, it\u0027s also possible that the wifi agent decides to send capport data from other sources in the future, or that we update a network agent (telephony, bluetooth...) to support sending other capport data.\n\nConsidering this, I think it would be better to merge all fields, not just friendly name / venue URL for the network agent data.\nI think for Passpoint you also need UserPortalUrl for the ToS ?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 6100,
        "startChar": 74,
        "endLine": 6101,
        "endChar": 35
      },
      "revId": "37d1fa36202bd04cf4c73d7c7a3f9b8252c81683",
